 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"百花丛里一茅堂，独坐时传百和香。\n隔帘谁放游蜂入，扑酒冲琴特恁狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56277,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园遣兴再赋十绝句 其五","author":"李梦阳","text":"分行种树非无意，薙秽薅烦亦用情。\n何事草蒿欺便得，芊芊满地不知名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56278,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园遣兴再赋十绝句 其六","author":"李梦阳","text":"旧种丁香间石榴，花时榴叶未曾抽。\n试看赤艳倾阳日，乱萼繁英何处求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56279,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园遣兴再赋十绝句 其七","author":"李梦阳","text":"护径扃园意自知，百年今日是花期。\n昨属客过贪劝酒，僮人背折两三枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56280,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园遣兴再赋十绝句 其八","author":"李梦阳","text":"呼童刈草栽吾菊，夹径分行补种葵。\n怕认野人为鲁相，旋刚修竹起东篱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56281,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园遣兴再赋十绝句 其九","author":"李梦阳","text":"人生无求心自宽，酒香花明身幸安。\n忘忧岂帝凭萱草，蠲铌何劳问合欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56282,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园遣兴再赋十绝句 其十","author":"李梦阳","text":"吾园亦在东门外，昨日清明手种瓜。\n不信邵平能五色，吾园兼有武陵花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56283,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"痔不可车旬日乃造于东园春葩向残夏英欲起慨焉动于老怀再赋绝句十首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"鲍归昨誇百结胜，惜我病阻孤春妍。\n岂谓今开两荆树，分枝的的照红烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56284,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"痔不可车旬日乃造于东园春葩向残夏英欲起慨焉动于老怀再赋绝句十首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"桃杏叶尖荷叶圆，杨花乱扑如白绵。\n若言春事浑无曲，榆荚缘何亦贯钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56285,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"痔不可车旬日乃造于东园春葩向残夏英欲起慨焉动于老怀再赋绝句十首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"昨当春色散年芳，竞媚争妍各擅场。\n一出牡丹诸便歇，固知渠是百花王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56286,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"痔不可车旬日乃造于东园春葩向残夏英欲起慨焉动于老怀再赋绝句十首 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"槛西新笋不太甚，一夜迸阶横我檐。\n汝虽天生刚直物，岂容出地头头尖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56287,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"痔不可车旬日乃造于东园春葩向残夏英欲起慨焉动于老怀再赋绝句十首 其五","author":"李梦阳","text":"吾园种种无樛木，两葛萦纡底自芳。\n客到更无愁醉酒，醉时但卧此花傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56288,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa9828