6d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋风曲","author":"李梦阳","text":"袅袅秋风生渌波，菱角鸡头满御河。\n藻间游鱼不知数，荷上灵龟浑未多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56307,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新立金川书院祠练公父子文碑幸成","author":"李梦阳","text":"力修书院缘栖主，碑石新成颇慰心。\n薄劣实惭文太减，特书应不待如今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56308,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴豫斋翁第次韵","author":"李梦阳","text":"面面危楼对曲台，枝枝花树向楼开。\n主人不有生生意，隙地宁容长绿莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56309,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端午曲二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"殿门朝凉虚縠垂，菖蒲艾叶青离离。\n千尺辘轳转金井，冰盘荐黍鸳鸯冷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56310,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端午曲二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"綵绳累累作端午，石青蜥蜴泥金虎。\n老奴催恩拜纨扇，香纱笼头半遮面。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56311,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"北叟临门种棘，南翁过路钩衣。\n楚楚纤鳞水跃，英英鸷翮云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56312,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"鹦鹉窥笼百遍，狝猴上树千回。\n紫燕衔泥入室，黄麋齧草登台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56313,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"西海昆丘阆苑，仙人王子安期。\n春至蟠桃艳艳，秋来弱水瀰瀰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56314,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"黄帝清游化国，虞皇穆拱玄宫。\n殷主爰消雏雉，文王载梦非熊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56315,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其五","author":"李梦阳","text":"种豆南山一顷，朝来丰草离离。\n岂若蓝田种玉，何如商岭餐芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56316,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其六","author":"李梦阳","text":"圃口翻翻瓠叶，门前潏潏流湍。\n凫鹭轻轻不下，鹓鸿冉冉高抟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56317,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜泛湖二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"水天上下一色，棹鸣波月同翻。\n渔舟欸乃何处，旁山杳冥吐吞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56318,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜泛湖二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"月鹭惊飞不见，遥看片帆影来。\n双桨如飞荡去，一道流光镜开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56319,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明山草亭","author":"李梦阳","text":"旧业门前五柳，绿橘黄柑数亩。\n烟霞不负閒身，社稷空馀白首。\n看月天拄峰头，采药洞庭湖口。\n扁舟薄暮归来，疑是沧波钓叟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56320,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南康除夕","author":"李梦阳","text":"夕阳山色湖波，将春夜寂风和。\n何事邻姬独哭，谁家金鼓时过。\n客舍萧萧酒烛，归人杳杳关河。\n览镜颜容尚在，方言儿女能歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56321,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神京乐四首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"蓟谷襟东海，居庸锁北门。\n王者本无外，天险壮乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56322,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神京乐四首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"天回金气合，星顺玉衡平。\n云生翡翠殿，日丽凤凰城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56323,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神京乐四首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"钟鸣长乐馆，乐奏未央宫。\n寿域皇图迥，钩陈紫极通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56324,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神京乐四首 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"卫霍干城旧，伊夔鼎鼐新。\n万年天子寿，四海一家春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56325,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望南城","author":"李梦阳","text":"南内夕烟敛，玉楼春望空。\n禁籞年年锁，园禽巢殿中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56326,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚出禁闼二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"夹城云气夕，露掌隐金盘。\n杨花白云乱，风起满长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56327,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"李梦阳","text":"白鹭青天映，红妆绿水遥。\n笑语荷花里，争荡木兰桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56328,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大堤曲","author":"李梦阳","text":"腊月大堤边，春风思宛然。\n杨枝摇白日，烟花袅金鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56329,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"盈盈绮闼女，生长不知春。\n开窗见百结，背面掩罗巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56330,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"父母爱少女，女是聪明子。\n生不识鸳鸯，绣出鸳鸯是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56331,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"三月大路旁，绿杨美芳春。\n可怜雪白花，来往送行人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56332,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月见花","author":"李梦阳","text":"长安桃李树，秋晚复花枝。\n九陌寒烟里，无风自落时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56333,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻笛","author":"李梦阳","text":"白日挂云间，谁家玉笛闲。\n北风吹杨柳，落叶满关山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56334,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曙","author":"李梦阳","text":"城云白欲曙，沙月上犹残。\n独步怜红叶，空庭玉露团。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56335,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望浦烟","author":"李梦阳","text":"客愁何处落，涤涤冬浦烟。\n日出浦烟歇，客愁还复然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56336,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日京中","author":"李梦阳","text":"白雁独横秋，黄花伴醉游。\n眼看风物换，愁杀仲宣楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56337,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月见雁","author":"李梦阳","text":"忆昨辞京邑，相随南雁归。\n如何早春日，独见北鸿飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56338,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出郭","author":"李梦阳","text":"出郭携尊屡，寻园步屧迟。\n莫言春事晚，犹是百花时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56339,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望野","author":"李梦阳","text":"久静山容敛，秋凝野色凄。\n白云留绝巘，苍雾隔前溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56340,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚出大堤侄叶来迓","author":"李梦阳","text":"袅袅绿杨西，双翻碧玉蹄。\n何由识小阮，为听紫骝嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56341,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石头口竹饮","author":"李梦阳","text":"白日竹林中，隤然脱巾醉。\n风吹乱叶响，醒看江日坠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56342,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南康元日","author":"李梦阳","text":"此日故乡酒，应怜千里违。\n是处萋萋草，王孙归不归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56343,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙沙晚行","author":"李梦阳","text":"晚风度疏松，琳琅动仙阙。\n回波滚明沙，错认地上月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56344,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻夜笛","author":"李梦阳","text":"五月梅花落，羁魂羌笛惊。\n孰能风月夜，更听陇头清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56345,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙沙见新月","author":"李梦阳","text":"每讶沙如月，龙蟠作后山。\n如何今夜月，却又学沙弯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56346,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村夜三首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"万物既有息，我亦中林卧。\n云开迥水白，地闪飞星过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村夜三首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"清林不知暑，一觉群鸡鸣。\n野圹气森飒，天空夜虚明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]